1
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,340
猛男主厨 美味出炉
Hot food from a hot man.

2
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,180
麦克斯 我那区有个女人问
Max, a woman in my section wants to know

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:08,860
咱们有没有无谷蛋白的食物
if we do anything gluten-free.

4
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,360
怎么回答
What do I tell her?

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,780
跟她说 别假装对谷蛋白过敏
Tell her she's not allergic to gluten,

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,400
来掩饰自己的饮食失调症
she's just masking an eating disorder.

7
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,020
各位 打起精神
Look alive, people.

8
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,900
总汇三明治 汉堡配中薯
Club sandwich, burger, medium,

9
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,020
以及给赌鬼的鲜虾沙拉
and a shrimp salad for the gamblin' man.

10
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:22,880
我要的盐和胡椒呢
I asked for salt and pepper.

11
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,780
我的蛋黄酱和芥末酱呢
I wanted mayonnaise and mustard.

12
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,900
你忘了我的无糖汽水
You forgot my diet soda.

13
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,660
抱歉 马上给您拿...
I'm sorry, I'll be right back with--

14
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:32,080
瞧 这是啥
Oh, what?

15
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,680
姐是有两把刷子的
Never doubt me.

16
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,260
最后一张单了 厄尔
Here's my last check, Earl.

17
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,120
瞧 麦克斯
Look here, Max.

18
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:55,920
那女的刚塞了她电话号码给我
That lady just slipped me her number.

19
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:59,060
老子难道还缺另一个绝经白师奶
Like i need another menopausal white woman

20
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,820
像猫发情挠窗一样地对我发情吗
scratchin' at my window like a cat in heat.

21
00:01:05,780 --> 00:01:07,140
天啊 我爱死钱了
God, I love money.

22
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:10,020
我懂 真遗憾钱不爱你了
I know, I'm so sorry it broke up with you.

23
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:14,580
瞧 这周Ipad2上市了
Look! This week's new Ipad just came out.

24
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,880
赶紧去广而搞之吧
Spread the words.

25
00:01:17,140 --> 00:01:17,440
是"告"啊
Word.

26
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:18,800
"高"啊
Word!

27
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:22,600
我是从电线杆上的广告学的
I saw that on the wire.

28
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:25,660
麦克斯 都三周了
Max, three weeks in a row,

29
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:28,720
你还没接受我脸书的加好友请求
you have not yet accepted my request to be a Facebook friend.

30
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:33,040
麦克斯 我跟你说话呢
Max? I am talking to you.

31
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:36,040
戴着耳机呢 听不见
I didn't hear you, I have my earbuds in.

32
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,100
那这是什么
What are these?

33
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:42,880
不到黄河心不死 不见棺材不掉泪吗
Okay, you had to bust a move, and get "the truth" on my ass?

34
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:43,880
好吧 那我就送你一程
Fine, let's go there.

35
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:46,180
憨 我永远都不会加你为好友的
Han, I'm never gonna be your Facebook friend.

36
00:01:46,994 --> 00:01:47,840
呜
Woo!

37
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,980
万箭穿心啊
Hard to hear.

38
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:53,120
没关系 我加了你 憨
Well, I accepted you, Han.

39
00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:56,580
谢谢 你让我心花怒放
Yes, thank you. You make my heart sing.

40
00:01:56,997 --> 00:01:58,379
呜
Woo!

41
00:01:58,379 --> 00:02:00,716
血还吧嗒吧嗒流呢
Hurts me still.

42
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:05,860
刚才就像看人拿木棒打爆小海豹一样
That was like watching someone club a baby seal.

43
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:10,140
干嘛不加他好友啊
Why wouldn't you just say yes to his friend request?

44
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:12,340
因为我从来不上脸书 加了干啥
Because I never check Facebook, why would I?

45
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:15,260
上脸书好让我零五年的同事
So some girl I worked at a movie theater with in 2005

46
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:17,560
能给我留言 今天下雨 她"灰常郁闷"吗
can tell me it's raining and she's "totes bummed?"

47
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:22,300
卡洛琳 最好检查下你脸书主页哟
Caroline! Better check Facebook page.

48
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,620
没准刚有人在你主页上贴了点东西呢
Maybe someone just post on your wall.

49
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:32,900
"李憨在二十五张照片中圈出了你"
"Han Lee has tagged you in 25 photos?"

50
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:43,820
想借我的海豹棒一用吗
Wanna borrow my seal club yet?

51
00:02:47,140 --> 00:02:47,920
太伤人了
That stings.

52
00:02:48,660 --> 00:02:52,280
我爸锒铛入狱后 我的脸书好友骤减了三百人
I've lost like 300 Facebook friends since my father was arrested.

53
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:55,280
没准你爸在牢里也交了这么多新好友呢
Well, your father's probably made that many new friends in prison,

54
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,360
有失必有得嘛
so it all evens out.

55
00:02:58,380 --> 00:02:59,640
好了 要走了吗
Okay, ready to go?

56
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:02,620
必须得走吗 外面热死了
Do we have to? It's so hot outside.

57
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,060
高温什么时候有这么吓人了
When did heat get so hot?

58
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,140
与其奋力挣扎 不如闭眼享受
Stop fighting it, just give in to it.

59
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:09,380
奇怪 我怎么用了强奸犯的台词
I don't know why I'm quoting a rapist.

60
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:15,200
我们不能再待会儿吗 家里都没有空调
Can't we just stay a little bit longer? We don't have any A.C. At home.

61
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:17,680
我有空调 你们可以过来用
I have an A.C. You girls can use.

62
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:20,300
你的空调能用啊
You have an air conditioner that works?

63
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,460
当然能用
Oh, it works.

64
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:34,180
你这台空调像刚吃过蒜味香肠似的
That's like an A.C. That just had salami.

65
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:38,180
这台空调还内建另一根"大香肠"呢
There's more salami where that came from.

66
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:47,000
我的脚疼死了
And my feet hurt.

67
00:03:47,380 --> 00:03:49,860
别踩"高跷"上班了 买双平民休闲鞋吧
Well, you gotta stop wearing those stilts, and get a pair of skechers,

68
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:51,360
破产女招待的基本配置
like normal broke-ass waitresses.

69
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:54,960
平民休闲鞋 这话你也说得出口
Skechers? How dare you.

70
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,300
再说了 我没钱买新鞋
Besides, I can't afford new shoes.

71
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,540
这双花了我九百块呢
These cost $900.

72
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:02,340
你的脚不是疼 是遭天谴
Well, then that's not pain, that's karma.

73
00:04:03,420 --> 00:04:05,280
我会帮你的 好吧
Look, I will help you out, okay?

74
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:08,020
我知道有个地方 花小钱也能买名牌
I know a place we can go that has designer things at good prices.

75
00:04:08,340 --> 00:04:09,360
就像巴尼时尚卖场吗
Like a Barney's Warehouse?

76
00:04:10,980 --> 00:04:11,860
差不多吧
Kind of.

77
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:18,620
善心二手店
The Goodwill?

78
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:20,660
欢迎来到我的地盘
Welcome to my place!

79
00:04:24,300 --> 00:04:26,060
你居然带我来买二手货
We're shopping at the Goodwill?

80
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:27,320
我还真以为你要带我去买好货呢
You led me to believe we were real-shopping.

81
00:04:28,220 --> 00:04:28,840
我猜到了
I know.

82
00:04:29,260 --> 00:04:31,300
我就想看你来到这家店时的表情
I couldn't wait to see your face when you saw this place.

83
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:31,980
再做一次
Do the face again.

84
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:33,640
爽死我了
I love it!

85
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,520
好吧 这是什么味儿
Okay, what's that smell?

86
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,800
这股穷酸味以后就是你的味儿
It's gonna be your smell from now on.

87
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:42,560
听好了 我告诉你好货在哪
Now, pay attention, I know where the good stuff is.

88
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,140
我知道好货在哪里
I know where the good stuff is.

89
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,920
在麦迪逊大街和五七街那儿[高档店街]
Madison and 57th.

90
00:04:46,740 --> 00:04:47,700
跟我来
Follow me.

91
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:51,460
心机女会把心头好藏起来 等回头再买
Clever bitches hide stuff they want to come back and buy,

92
00:04:51,660 --> 00:04:54,260
因为有时她们连三块钱都没有
'cause sometimes they don't have $3 to buy it at the time.

93
00:04:54,660 --> 00:04:55,920
谁会没有三块钱啊
Who doesn't have $3?

94
00:04:56,540 --> 00:04:57,000
比如你呀
You.

95
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,340
上周我把一件超帅的复古外套
Last week I hid a dope vintage blazer

96
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:02,100
藏到柜子后面的抽屉里
in the back of a nightstand, and

97
00:05:02,100 --> 00:05:03,360
瞧
here it is!

98
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:05,180
六块钱 心机女 手到擒来
Six bucks, clever bitch. Bang, bang!

99
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:09,760
好吧 既然都来了 我就好好淘淘吧
All right, well, we're here. I'm gonna make the best of it,

100
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:12,440
不过得先找个没有刨冰渍的篮子
but first I need a basket without a sno-cone in it.

101
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,000
翠丽丝[像上层社会名字]
Hey, Trish.

102
00:05:15,420 --> 00:05:17,460
平时不穿 去乡村俱乐部时穿
Not for day-to-day, but at the country club.

103
00:05:18,340 --> 00:05:19,820
你搞笑啊 不过还真没说错
You're kidding, but you're right.

104
00:05:21,820 --> 00:05:24,200
看上某件衣服后 记得检查口袋有没有药丸
When you find something, check the pockets for pills.

105
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,760
我有次在市区旧衣店
At a thrift store downtown

106
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,440
我找到了一颗紫色药丸
I found a purple one once, and took it.

107
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,920
吃完我昏睡了八个小时
Fell asleep for eight hours.

108
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,920
就当是我那年的年假了
That was my vacation that year.

109
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:35,060
好耶 鞋子
Yay, shoes!

110
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:38,620
真不敢相信我居然在二手店里欢呼
I can't believe I just said, "yay", in Goodwill.

111
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:41,680
先别高兴太早 鞋子可能会有异味
Look, don't freak. Shoes can be funky,

112
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,860
但我家有一瓶特殊喷雾 一喷异味全无
but I have a special spray at home that makes them like new.

113
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,180
能救破店的鞋 难不成是巫师的药水吗
Did you get it from a wizard?

114
00:05:51,140 --> 00:05:52,300
我的天啊
Oh, my God.

115
00:05:54,340 --> 00:05:57,720
天呀 这双名牌高跟鞋是我的
Oh, my God, these Brian Atwoods were mine.

116
00:05:57,940 --> 00:05:59,540
因为穿着它见过两次报
I donated these to charity,

117
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:01,620
所以我就捐给慈善机构了
'cause I was photographed wearing them twice.

118
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:06,780
我当时可是花了八百大洋买的 现在只值八块
Okay, they were $800 when I bought them, now they're $8?

119
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:09,660
就像我
Like me.

120
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,800
身价暴跌
I'm $8.

121
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,820
天啊
Oh, my god.

122
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,360
我只值八块
I'm $8.

123
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,060
我被降价了
I've been reduced.

124
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:25,240
抱歉 贫穷感突然排山倒海地袭来
I'm sorry, it just all became so real to me.

125
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:27,360
这事实好难接受
I mean, I can't believe it.

126
00:06:33,380 --> 00:06:34,880
你没看见我在哭吗
Didn't you see me crying?

127
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:38,300
善心二手店每天都有大把人哭
Lots of people cry at Goodwill.

128
00:06:40,220 --> 00:06:42,900
去法国就会吃蜗牛 来这里就会眼泪流
You go to France, you eat snails. You come here, you cry.

129
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:47,280
太怪了吧 你居然完全没反应
That's odd, you didn't even react.

130
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:49,580
听到别人哭 你得有点反应啊
You need to react when people cry.

131
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,140
我有啊 我翻了个白眼
I did, I rolled my eyes.

132
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:56,600
终有一天 你会学会泪往心里流
Look, eventually, you'll learn to do that on the inside.

133
00:06:58,220 --> 00:07:00,160
好吧 我告诉你
Okay, well, just FYI,

134
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,040
以前我在其他闺蜜面前哭时
when i used to cry in front of my other girlfriends,

135
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:04,120
她们会说 小琳琳 你在哭什么呢
they'd be like, "what you cryin' about, C-line? "

136
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:07,580
妹子 你可是又犀利又迷人哟
Look at you, girl, you're fierce, you got your glam on.

137
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,920
你的闺蜜都是黑人变装癖娘炮吧
Are your girlfriends black drag queens?

138
00:07:16,700 --> 00:07:18,060
哇 这件鼓击乐队的T恤好赞呀
Oh, awesome Strokes tee.

139
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:20,960
我有去那场演唱会 当时买不起这T恤
I went to this concert, but I couldn't afford the shirt.

140
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:22,640
所以我的话题到此结束了
Oh, we're done with me.

141
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:26,940
我大三那年暑假去看他们的巡演
I went to see them on this tour the summer after my junior year.

142
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:29,484
那是个燥热的夜晚 我溜出家里
It was a really warm night, and I snuck out of the house,

143
00:07:29,484 --> 00:07:30,421
然后我们一起做...
and we all ma-- ahem.

144
00:07:30,740 --> 00:07:31,640
没啥啦
Whatever.

145
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:33,420
做了什么呀
And what?

146
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,960
说呀 那晚是不是发生了什么好事
What, did something great happen the night you got the T?

147
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,680
瞧我这样 像是有好事光临过吗
Look at me, does it look like something great ever happens?

148
00:07:39,820 --> 00:07:42,460
这T恤不错 是我先看上的
Hey, cute tee. Had my eye on it.

149
00:07:42,700 --> 00:07:44,300
我过去叫朋友来帮我看看
I was just bringin' my girl back to see it.

150
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:45,340
她刚去厕所了
She was in the bathroom.

151
00:07:45,860 --> 00:07:47,280
我刚在吐
I had to throw up.

152
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:50,660
-乖乖交出来 -你又不是不知道规矩
- So hand it over. - You know the rule.

153
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:52,900
出其不意 攻其不备
Turn the back on the rack, you're under attack.

154
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:57,240
别怪我 这是二手店的法则
That's not me, that's the law of the 'will.

155
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:02,940
就是 你俩快滚吧
Yeah, you better walk away.

156
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:07,280
刚真是剑拔弩张啊
That was intense.

157
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:09,140
这在二手店是老生常谈了
Just another Wednesday at the 'will.

158
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:12,220
你说好货是被人藏起来的 是吧
You said to look in things, right?

159
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,220
麦克斯 瞧 初战告捷
Max, look. On my first try!

160
00:08:17,344 --> 00:08:20,640
干得好 藏这货的人该七窍生烟了
Ooh, slick. Whoever hid those is gonna be pissed.

161
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:21,560
检查质量
Quality check.

162
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:27,340
布料完好 胯部无不明污渍
Fabric sturdy, no mysterious crotch stains,

163
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:28,600
不错啊 少女妙探
nice work, Nancy Drew.

164
00:08:29,220 --> 00:08:31,280
瞧 还是名牌呢
And look, they're designer.

165
00:08:31,540 --> 00:08:33,740
零九年夏装 售价三百五十美元
Summer 2009. $350.

166
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,980
而今天我的到手价是
And for me today...

167
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:40,020
五块钱 我就喜欢这种降价
$5. That's a reduction I like.

168
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,180
你好啊 玛丽亚
Hi, Maria.

169
00:08:51,060 --> 00:08:52,260
最近好吗 麦克斯
How are you, Max?

