335
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,180
我有一堆屁事要忙
Well, I had a lot of crap to do.

336
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:42,720
你给我的感觉像是你会来啊
Well, you gave me the impression you were going.

337
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:45,440
有吗 我才不给人什么感觉
I gave you the impression? I don't do impressions.

338
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:47,740
等等 其实也不是 我会模仿我妈
Well, wait, that's not true, I do one, my mom.

339
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,740
但要模仿出她 需要一颗圣诞树
But to do that. I need a christmas tree,

340
00:17:49,820 --> 00:17:51,760
一加仑伏特加 和一根点燃的香烟
a gallon of vodka, and a lit cigarette.

341
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,800
所以我们到底要不要做闺蜜
So are we gonna be girlfriends or not?

342
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:58,120
听着 我就直说吧
Look, I'm gonna give this to you straight up.

343
00:17:58,840 --> 00:18:01,500
我真的做不了你要的那种闺蜜
I am never gonna be the type of girlfriend you're used to.

344
00:18:01,780 --> 00:18:04,100
我不会当姐妹 也不是你的姐妹儿
I am not your gir-r-r, or your gir-r-rl,

345
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:06,380
我也不是会为了折扣
and I am definitely not someone's

346
00:18:07,260 --> 00:18:08,720
而跟你一起做美甲的人
two-for-one girlfriend crap at a nail store.

347
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:10,720
老实说 你就当我是个爷们吧
In fact, think of me as a dude.

348
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:13,760
那 咱俩没事吧
So-o-o, are we good?

349
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:15,980
嗯 没事
Yeah. We good.

350
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:18,040
我懂 你天生不是当闺蜜的料
I get it. You're not a girl's girl.

351
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:19,180
好 很好
Okay, good.

352
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:23,760
我可是块当闺蜜的料哟
I can be a girl's girl.

353
00:18:30,020 --> 00:18:33,640
卡洛琳 请你的马别再来占我便宜了
Caroline, please do not take advantage of me with your horse.

354
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:34,620
什么
What?

355
00:18:35,100 --> 00:18:37,280
垃圾清理公司现在跟我多要钱
My trash pick up company charged me extra,

356
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:39,520
因为我的大垃圾桶里全是你的马粪
because my dumpster is full of all your horse droppings.

357
00:18:41,180 --> 00:18:42,660
这怎么可能
How would that be possible?

358
00:18:42,820 --> 00:18:45,740
我看见你的好朋友麦克斯 天天早上帮你遛马
I see your good friend, Max, walking your horse every morning

359
00:18:45,740 --> 00:18:47,740
还把马粪全扔我垃圾桶里
and dropping droppings in my dumpster.

360
00:18:50,700 --> 00:18:51,660
-你好吗 -好啊
- Hi. - Hello.

361
00:18:52,780 --> 00:18:54,340
你今天早上帮我遛马了吗
Did you walk my horse today?

362
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:56,040
是啊 每天早上都遛
Yeah, and every other morning.

363
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:59,320
真贴心 怎么不早点告诉我
That's so sweet. I wish I had known.

364
00:18:59,620 --> 00:19:01,740
是要我怎么说 去你脸书主页上留言吗
Well, what was I gonna do, post it on your facebook wall?

365
00:19:01,940 --> 00:19:04,320
"唉 今儿个又遛马 恶心屎我了"
"Ha, walked a horse again today. Totes gross."

366
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:07,300
再说了 除了我还会有别人干吗
Besides, who did you think was doing it?

367
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,640
以前凡事都不用我动手
I've always just had things done for me,

368
00:19:09,700 --> 00:19:11,940
我也从没想过事儿都是谁做的
I've never really thought about the people doing them.

369
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:15,080
可我天生穷苦命 凡事都得亲力亲为
Yeah, and I've never had things done for me, so I just do them.

370
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:17,260
比如现在 我在做咖啡
Like now, how I'm making the coffee,

371
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:19,280
你就在旁边傻站闲着
and you're just standing here watching me.

372
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:23,080
你还是应该早点说的 我好谢谢你
Still, I wish you would have told me,so I could say thank you.

373
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,400
这不是我的风格
Well, it's not really my style.

374
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:26,960
你还真是个难捉摸的爷们
You are one complicated dude.

375
00:19:27,341 --> 00:19:29,664
上菜 罗宋汤
Pick up, borscht.

376
00:19:35,020 --> 00:19:36,360
-我靠 -怎么了
- Unbelievable. - What?

377
00:19:40,345 --> 00:19:43,942
两位好呀 鼓击乐队T恤真好看
How you guys doin'? Cute Strokes tee.

378
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:45,280
可能我穿会更好看
Probably look better on me,

379
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:46,400
因为这衣服本来就是我的
considering it's mine.

380
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:48,280
一不留神 人事已非 贱货[西语]
You snooze, you lose, puta.

381
00:19:52,780 --> 00:19:53,820
巧舌如簧啊
Nice language!

382
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:56,940
你就用这舌头跟你基爆的小男友舌吻吗
You kiss your obviously closeted boyfriend with that mouth?

383
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:01,440
不过姐现在也不想要了
You know what? I wouldn't even want it now.

384
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:02,920
被你穿过后
Now that it's been on you,

385
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:04,700
鼓击乐队看起来跟肯尼·基一样瞎
might as well have been a Kenny G shirt.

386
00:20:06,500 --> 00:20:08,480
现在姐要走人了
And now I walk.

387
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:12,080
你不能让她得逞啊
You can't just let her win.

388
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:13,420
算了 就这样吧
Forget it, it's over.

389
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:16,040
罗宋汤 上菜 快上菜
Borscht! Pick up, pick up.

390
00:20:23,540 --> 00:20:24,420
我马上为您服务
I'll be right with you.

391
00:20:25,940 --> 00:20:26,560
蠢货
Idiota!

392
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:31,880
这衣服花了我四块钱呢 我要杀了你[西语]
Esta camiseta me costo cuatro dolares! Te voy a cortar.

393
00:20:32,800 --> 00:20:35,900
抱歉 都怪我不好[西语]
Lo siento. Todo es mi culpa.

394
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:39,300
我才来第一周 还有点笨手笨脚
I'm still a little clumsy, it's my first week.

395
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:41,820
我给您端杯苏打水来洗洗 但说真的
I'll bring you some soda water, but seriously,

396
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:43,820
污渍没洗掉 你男人就掉进别的男人怀抱了
your boyfriend will come out before that borscht stain does.

397
00:20:50,700 --> 00:20:52,940
-干得漂亮 -就是
- That was awesome. - Yeah.

398
00:20:52,940 --> 00:20:54,500
我向来只做事 不废话
I kinda just do stuff.

399
00:20:54,500 --> 00:20:55,760
就像刚那样
Like I just did,

400
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:57,680
我下手 而你却在旁边傻站闲着
while you were standing there watching me.

401
00:20:58,200 --> 00:21:01,686
谢谢你 好姐妹儿
Thank you, gir-r-rlfriend.

402
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:04,380
-糟糕 -怎么 她来报仇了吗
- Oh,no - What, is she coming for me?

403
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:04,820
快跑
Run.
